# sandbox-configs: the job and cluster descriptions that cloudflow reads.
# Read by exportit/tools/export.py; described in exportit/MAP.md.
#
# Both directories, every file, unchanged and with their identifiers in them
# (stage 6, decision 1), templates and site data together (decision 2). They
# keep their names, so that the paths in cloudflow's documentation still hold.

covers job.configs/
covers cluster.configs/
copy job.configs/        job.configs/
copy cluster.configs/    cluster.configs/
# The templates and examples belong to cloudflow since spec 005: they show how
# cloudflow is used, and it checks them against the schema it publishes. The
# copy rules above still take them, so the lineage is as it was made; a sync
# carries the original's changes to them into cloudflow. Generated from
# tests/catalogue.json's roles (template, example) on 2026-11-23.
moved cluster.configs/local.config                                           cloudflow  examples/configs/cluster.configs/local.config
moved cluster.configs/template.ioos                                          cloudflow  examples/configs/cluster.configs/template.ioos
moved job.configs/CORA/cora.reanalysis                                       cloudflow  examples/configs/job.configs/CORA/cora.reanalysis
